{"matched":50,"pages":[{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0310a01","n":"0310a","t":"不必同雖必同世若與現行和"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0310b01","n":"0310b","t":"更生現行種望於種類亦應爾"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0310c01","n":"0310c","t":"果現起故相易知故種望於種"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0311a01","n":"0311a","t":"恒轉二理顯種子義餘但別遮"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0311c01","n":"0311c","t":"以因一故果既有異因亦應殊"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0312a01","n":"0312a","t":"云作不作失得過故成相違外"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0312b01","n":"0312b","t":"引因說枯喪等故說頌言枯喪"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0313b01","n":"0313b","t":"不受熏習如堅石等故虛空等"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0313c01","n":"0313c","t":"二俱持即成一種生二芽過如"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0314a01","n":"0314a","t":"無能緣用異熟心等有能緣用"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0314b01","n":"0314b","t":"具足如無分別智入見以去漸"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0314c01","n":"0314c","t":"七識因七之類亦應能熏若以"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0315a01","n":"0315a","t":"現耶心等一時不可並故又生"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0315b01","n":"0315b","t":"二真假異熟五果果相分別第"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0315c01","n":"0315c","t":"或行境之行解相貌此解亦非"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0316a01","n":"0316a","t":"及此論等通依現種二執受義"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0316b01","n":"0316b","t":"與五十一顯揚等別彼言遍計"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0316c01","n":"0316c","t":"第八識雖緣種子不緣無想定"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0317a01","n":"0317a","t":"聲對法第五說非執受故唯為"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0317b01","n":"0317b","t":"種等具二變義外器唯一七識"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0317c01","n":"0317c","t":"申自義後方破他此出自義謂"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n