line.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0326a01","n":"0326a","t":"伽論五十四卷彼極分別應如"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0326b01","n":"0326b","t":"以無體用故於有法中略有二"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0326c01","n":"0326c","t":"青等應非實問若隨因緣變必"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0327a01","n":"0327a","t":"必有用若論依他假因緣起亦"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0327b01","n":"0327b","t":"心所法今解無為不相應行亦"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0327c01","n":"0327c","t":"中但有護法正義總結於前三"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0328a01","n":"0328a","t":"八識恒體有此答上座及末經"}],"scheme":"cbeta","slug":"cbeta-T-T43n1830-成唯識論述記卷003a","source":"CBETA T43n1830 @ xml-p5 dbdea41","total":113,"unit":"T43 頁欄"}